      "label": "juxtaposed_meme_scene",
      "description": "A scene where a historical photograph of Adolf Hitler is visually juxtaposed with casual, humorous text that trivializes his legacy by associating him with a mundane activity (camping). The scene is intentionally offensive and hateful, using the stark contrast between the gravitas of Hitler's image and the absurdity of the text to provoke discomfort or laughter at the expense of his historical atrocities.",
