      "description": "The meme expresses a grotesque, mocking, and offensive emotion by juxtaposing the image of Adolf Hitler with the absurd, trivializing text about 'camping'. This creates a form of dark humor intended to shock and provoke discomfort, not genuine amusement, and is rooted in antisemitic and Holocaust-denial/minimization themes.",
